          "type": "su",
          "description": "3/day, a mythril golem shoots out a blast of lava from its forehead. The mythril golem must make a ranged touch attack to hit, and if the ray hits, it deals 16d6 points of fire damage and the target must make a Fortitude save (DC 28) or be inflicted with Burning and Entrangled status effects. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 7th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana or Technology DC 29).",
          "notes": {
