        {
          "name": "Rock Throw",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "Mythril golem throws a huge boulder and hurls it at a foe. Mythril golem makes a ranged touch attack roll against a target within 30 feet. If the attack hits, he deals 3d6+11 points of earth damage and the target must make a Fortitude save (DC 28) or be inflicted with Slow status for 1d4 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 3rd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana or Technology DC 19).",
